madvise_remove_anonymous: EINVAL
madvise_cold: ok, pages stay resident
dontneed_private_anonymous: first bytes of 4 pages 00 00 00 00
dontneed_shared_anonymous: first bytes of 4 pages 33 33 33 33
dontneed_memfd: first bytes of 4 pages 44 44 44 44
mremap_shrink: ok, the cut-off 96 MiB left the resident size
mremap_grow: ok, whole block usable yes
munmap_page: ok, neighbours readable 11, the gap unmapped
mprotect_4096_piece: ok, the pieces next to it readable 11
gc_reserve: flat, decommitted pages left the resident size
mprotect_none: ok, contents back yes
